 //   Pre:  - vaddr is in user space
 //         - vmem.inv()
 //   Post: - If the page was mapped: it is removed, the UserFrame is returned (ownership back)
 //         - If the page was not mapped: Ok(None), no state change
 //         - All other mappings are unchanged
 //         - vmem.inv() is preserved

