 //==================================================================================================
 //
 // Caller contract (ctrl_upage):
 //   Pre:  - vaddr is in user space and mapped
 //         - vmem.inv()
 //   Post: - The permission of the mapping at vaddr is updated
 //         - VA and PA are unchanged
 //         - All other mappings are unchanged
 //         - vmem.inv() is preserved

